[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3508567470","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112571#issuecomment-3508567470","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112571","id":3508567470,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RIH2u","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-09T17:53:44Z","updated_at":"2025-11-09T17:53:49Z","body":"> For compatibility, the signal must be fired after the animation has completely stopped.\r\n\r\nMay be worth commenting this as it's a bit odd?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3508567470/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3508676513","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112571#issuecomment-3508676513","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112571","id":3508676513,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RIieh","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-09T18:49:37Z","updated_at":"2025-11-09T18:49:37Z","body":"The original code before https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110508 is:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid AnimationPlayer::_blend_post_process() {\r\n\tif (end_reached) {\r\n\t\t// If the method track changes current animation, the animation is not finished.\r\n\t\tif (tmp_from == playback.current.from->animation->get_instance_id()) {\r\n\t\t\tif (playback_queue.size()) {\r\n\t\t\t\tString old = playback.assigned;\r\n\t\t\t\tplay(playback_queue.front()->get());\r\n\t\t\t\tString new_name = playback.assigned;\r\n\t\t\t\tplayback_queue.pop_front();\r\n\t\t\t\tif (end_notify) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\temit_signal(SceneStringName(animation_changed), old, new_name);\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t} else {\r\n\t\t\t\t_clear_caches();\r\n\t\t\t\tplaying = false; // <- Stop internal\r\n\t\t\t\t_set_process(false); // <- Stop process\r\n\t\t\t\tif (end_notify) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\temit_signal(SceneStringName(animation_finished), playback.assigned); // <- Emit animation finished \r\n\t\t\t\t\temit_signal(SNAME(\"current_animation_changed\"), \"\");\r\n\t\t\t\t\tif (movie_quit_on_finish && OS::get_singleton()->has_feature(\"movie\")) {\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut after #110508:\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid AnimationPlayer::_blend_post_process() {\r\n\tif (!finished_anim.is_empty()) {\r\n\t\temit_signal(SceneStringName(animation_finished), finished_anim);  // <- Emit animation finished \r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tif (end_reached) {\r\n\t\t// If the method track changes current animation, the animation is not finished.\r\n\t\tif (tmp_from == playback.current.from->animation->get_instance_id()) {\r\n\t\t\tif (playback_queue.size()) {\r\n\t\t\t\tString old = playback.assigned;\r\n\t\t\t\tplay(playback_queue.front()->get());\r\n\t\t\t\tString new_name = playback.assigned;\r\n\t\t\t\tplayback_queue.pop_front();\r\n\t\t\t\tif (end_notify) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\temit_signal(SceneStringName(animation_changed), old, new_name);\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t} else {\r\n\t\t\t\t_clear_caches();\r\n\t\t\t\tplaying = false; // <- Stop internal\r\n\t\t\t\t_set_process(false); // <- Stop process\r\n\t\t\t\tif (end_notify) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\temit_signal(SNAME(\"current_animation_changed\"), \"\");\r\n\t\t\t\t\tif (movie_quit_on_finish && OS::get_singleton()->has_feature(\"movie\")) {\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe finished signal is emitted before stop AnimationPlayer process, so it should be emitted after stop the process.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3508676513/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3564658180","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112571#issuecomment-3564658180","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112571","id":3564658180,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UeF4E","user":